fields.doc:
A table holding the data of the event. "OnSdkInitializedEvent" { "countryCode" - string, country code for this user "consentFlowUserGeography" - number, user's geography used to determine the type of consent flow shown to the user. Possible values are `applovin.CONSENT_FLOW_USER_GEOGRAPHY_UNKNOWN`, `applovin.CONSENT_FLOW_USER_GEOGRAPHY_GDPR`, `applovin.CONSENT_FLOW_USER_GEOGRAPHY_OTHER`
"isTestModeEnabled" - boolean, whether or not test mode is enabled for this session "appTrackingStatus" - number, ios only, whether or not the user authorizes access to app-related data that can be used for tracking the user or the device. Possible values are `applovin.APP_TRACKING_TRANSPARENCY_STATUS_UNAVAILABLE`, `applovin.APP_TRACKING_TRANSPARENCY_STATUS_NOT_DETERMINED`, `applovin.APP_TRACKING_TRANSPARENCY_STATUS_RESTRICTED`, `applovin.APP_TRACKING_TRANSPARENCY_STATUS_DENIED`, `applovin.APP_TRACKING_TRANSPARENCY_STATUS_AUTHORIZED` },
"OnCmpCompletedEvent" - empty table on successful completion OR { "code" - number, error code "message" - string, error message "cmpCode" - number, error code returned by the CMP "cmpMessage" - string, error message returned by the CMP }
Ad loaded, displayed, hidden, clicked, expanded, collapsed, revenue paid event { "adUnitIdentifier" - string, ad unit id for which this ad was loaded. Guaranteed not to be null "networkName" - string, the ad network for which this ad was loaded from. Guaranteed not to be null "creativeIdentifier" - string, the creative id tied to the ad, if any. You can report creative issues to the corresponding ad network using this id "placement" - string, the ad placement which was set for this ad. May be null "revenue" - number, the ad’s revenue amount. In the case where no revenue amount exists, or it is not available yet, will return a value of 0 }
"OnRewardedAdReceivedRewardEvent" will receive the following parameters in addition to above parameters { "label" - string, currency label "amount" - number, reward amount }
Ad load failed, displayed failed event { "adUnitIdentifier" - string, ad unit id for this ad "code" - number, error code for the error "message" - string, error message for the error }
